given bots: int(1..10)

given shelf_y: int(1..10)
given shelf_x: int(1..20)

given space_btwn_shelf_x: int(1..10)
given space_btwn_shelf_y: int(1..10)

given n_shelves_across: int(1..50)
given n_shelves_down: int(1..50)

given x_edge_size: int(1..50)
given y_edge_size: int(1..20)

$ 1D Array of size # of rows * # of columns
letting map_size be (n_shelves_across * shelf_x + (x_edge_size * 2)) * (n_shelves_down * shelf_y + (y_edge_size * 2))

find x: matrix indexed by [int(0..map_size)] of int(0..1)
such that
	sum(x)=bots
